re.types.ts:25"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Allows rows to be pinned to top or bottom regions."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Provide a predicate to decide per row. Defaults to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"keeppinnedrows","children":[{"type":"text","value":"keepPinnedRows?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional keepPinnedRows: boolean;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-pinning/rowPinningFeature.types.ts#L29","children":[{"type":"text","value":"features/row-pinning/rowPinningFeature.types.ts:29"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"When "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"},{"type":"text","value":", pinned rows will not be visible if they are filtered or paginated out of the table. When "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":", pinned rows will always be visible regardless of filtering or pagination. Defaults to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"onrowpinningchange","children":[{"type":"text","value":"onRowPinningChange?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional onRowPinningChange: OnChangeFn<RowPinningState>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-pinning/rowPinningFeature.types.ts#L35","children":[{"type":"text","value":"features/row-pinning/rowPinningFeature.types.ts:35"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Called with an updater when row pinning state changes. Pair this with\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"state.rowPinning"},{"type":"text","value":" when using external state; external atoms can own the\nslice without this callback."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"interface-tableoptions-rowpinningtfeatures-tdata","text":"Interface: TableOptions_RowPinning<TFeatures, TData>","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"enablerowpinning","text":"enableRowPinning?","level":3},{"id":"keeppinnedrows","text":"keepPinnedRows?","level":3},{"id":"onrowpinningchange","text":"onRowPinningChange?","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Interface: TableOptions\\_RowPinning\\<TFeatures, TData\\>\n\nDefined in: [features/row-pinning/rowPinningFeature.types.ts:16](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-pinning/rowPinningFeature.types.ts#L16)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* [`RowData`](../type-aliases/RowData.md)\n\n## Properties\n\n### enableRowPinning?\n\n```ts\noptional enableRowPinning: boolean | (row) => boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/row-pinning/rowPinningFeature.types.ts:25](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-pinning/rowPinningFeature.types.ts#L25)\n\nAllows rows to be pinned to top or bottom regions.\n\nProvide a predicate to decide per row. Defaults to `true`.\n\n***\n\n### keepPinnedRows?\n\n```ts\noptional keepPinnedRows: boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/row-pinning/rowPinningFeature.types.ts:29](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-pinning/rowPinningFeature.types.ts#L29)\n\nWhen `false`, pinned rows will not be visible if they are filtered or paginated out of the table. When `true`, pinned rows will always be visible regardless of filtering or pagination. Defaults to `true`.\n\n***\n\n### onRowPinningChange?\n\n```ts\noptional onRowPinningChange: OnChangeFn<RowPinningState>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/row-pinning/rowPinningFeature.types.ts:35](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-pinning/rowPinningFeature.types.ts#L35)\n\nCalled with an updater when row pinning state changes. Pair this with\n`state.rowPinning` when using external state; external atoms can own the\nslice without this callback.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: TableOptions_RowPinning\ntitle: TableOptions_RowPinning\n---\n\n# Interface: TableOptions\\_RowPinning\\<TFeatures, TData\\>\n\nDefined in: [features/row-pinning/rowPinningFeature.types.ts:16](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-pinning/rowPinningFeature.types.ts#L16)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* [`RowData`](../type-aliases/RowData.md)\n\n## Properties\n\n### enableRowPinning?\n\n```ts\noptional enableRowPinning: boolean | (row) => boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/row-pinning/rowPinningFeature.types.ts:25](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-pinning/rowPinningFeature.types.ts#L25)\n\nAllows rows to be pinned to top or bottom regions.\n\nProvide a predicate to decide per row. Defaults to `true`.\n\n***\n\n### keepPinnedRows?\n\n```ts\noptional keepPinnedRows: boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/row-pinning/rowPinningFeature.types.ts:29](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-pinning/rowPinningFeature.types.ts#L29)\n\nWhen `false`, pinned rows will not be visible if they are filtered or paginated out of the table. When `true`, pinned rows will always be visible regardless of filtering or pagination. Defaults to `true`.\n\n***\n\n### onRowPinningChange?\n\n```ts\noptional onRowPinningChange: OnChangeFn<RowPinningState>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/row-pinning/rowPinningFeature.types.ts:35](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-pinning/rowPinningFeature.types.ts#L35)\n\nCalled with an updater when row pinning state changes. Pair this with\n`state.rowPinning` when using external state; external atoms can own the\nslice without this callback.\n"}
